#v(8pt)
#text(weight: "bold", size: 10.5pt)[ABOUT ME]
#line(length: 100%, stroke: 0.5pt)
#v(4pt)
Final-year Computer Engineering student at Universidad Austral, oriented towards creating efficient software products. I have practical experience in designing scalable backend systems, application development, and cloud infrastructure management. I focus on delivering robust solutions covering the entire software development lifecycle, from initial architecture to production deployment.

