#grid(columns: (1fr, auto), [*PrintScript (Custom Language)*], [2024])
Typed scripting language implemented in Kotlin: lexer, recursive descent parser, and interpreter. Unambiguous grammar, semantic analysis.
- Stack: Kotlin, Gradle, JUnit.

#v(4pt)
#grid(columns: (1fr, auto), [*Snippets Platform (with PrintScript)*], [2024])
Web platform to organize and execute snippets using a custom-built language from scratch. Microservices architecture, sandbox execution.
- Stack: Spring Boot (Kotlin), Spring Cloud, React, PostgreSQL, Docker. Deploy: Azure.

#v(4pt)
#grid(columns: (1fr, auto), [*Android Crypto Tracker*], [2025])
Native app for real-time cryptocurrency prices with alerts and portfolio visualization. REST/WebSocket integration, MVVM architecture.
- Stack: Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Coroutines, Retrofit, Room. #link("https://github.com/husseymarcos/MetaCap")[GitHub]

#v(4pt)
#grid(columns: (1fr, auto), [*Electronic Health Records System (Ophthalmology)*], [2025])
Portal for ophthalmology clinics: medical records, studies, appointments, and reminders. Confidentiality compliance, role design, and multi-branch scalability.
- Stack: Spring Boot (Kotlin), Spring Security, JWT, React, PostgreSQL. Deploy: AWS.

